# Run artifacts — Elle histories are multi-MB per run and regenerated by
# certify-local.sh. Evidence worth keeping goes to the fly-accord-elle
# certification records, not here.
#
# EXCEPT evidence/: a RECORDED verdict needs its raw history committed next to
# it, or the verdict is an assertion rather than evidence. Runs are still not
# kept here by default — only the ones a certification record cites, filed
# under a timestamped directory and listed in CERTIFICATION.md.
*.edn
!evidence/**

# The nemesis legs are RECORDED in CERTIFICATION.md but their ~20 MB
# histories are not committed; certify-local.sh reproduces them.
evidence/*nemesis*/
